{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSToolBarTopV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSToolBarTop","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"title":"OUDSToolBarTop","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSToolBarTop","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstoolbartop"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSToolBarTop","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:trailingItems:)"},{"type":"text","text":"  View helper applies a SwiftUI toolbar configuration."}]},{"text":"Appearances","anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the "},{"code":"oudsNavigationBarAppearance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helper of "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the "},{"code":"NavigationStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for example."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Technical constraints","type":"heading","anchor":"Technical-constraints"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Platform considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Platform-considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Badges uses","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Badges-uses"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the OUDS badge component does not provide a suitable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  OUDS badge component is always used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Code sample","type":"heading","anchor":"Code-sample"},{"code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            trailingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Design documentation","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tool-bar-top"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Liquid Glass","anchor":"Liquid-Glass"},{"level":4,"text":"Orange","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_light"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-